name tsemlines
category Package
revision 23440
shortdesc Support for the ancient \emline macro
relocated 1
longdesc Occasional Documents appear, that use graphics generated by
longdesc texcad from the emtex distribution. These documents often use
longdesc the \emline macro, which produced lines at an arbitrary
longdesc orientation. The present package emulates the macro, using
longdesc TikZ.
runfiles size=1
